EnvIF builds on AutoIF:

Dong et al., Self-play with Execution Feedback: Improving Instruction-following
Capabilities of Large Language Models, ICLR 2025.
https://arxiv.org/abs/2406.13542

Original AutoIF pipeline scripts (code/1_RFT.py through 9_sft_data_construction.py
and the DPO construction steps) follow that work. EnvIF-specific additions include
domain data, EnvIF-Bench, typed layered reward, and evaluation scripts under MIT.
